      "en": "I behaved myself as though it had been my friend or my brother. I bowed down mourning, as one who mourns his mother.",
      "ko": "내가 나의 친구와 형제에게 행함 같이 저희에게 행하였으며 내가 굽히고 슬퍼하기를 모친을 곡함 같이 하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "b7b6bcbf2f173e52a45b09910a2a5228c96e05d1f57aaf6e07fdc178b451351d",
      "translation_text_hash": "449828db290f0d9bf7054b5e91d1504e9351f5133e87754786ada6b74086f05a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
