      "en": "But in my adversity, they rejoiced, and gathered themselves together. The attackers gathered themselves together against me, and I didn’t know it. They tore at me, and didn’t cease.",
      "ko": "오직 내가 환난을 당하매 저희가 기뻐하여 서로 모임이여 비류가 나의 알지 못하는 중에 모여 나를 치며 찢기를 마지 아니하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "9547645a4cf7e87d2039dac607b7dff9e461d8165786d1ca110fa18c62bd37db",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe409f55ce189eeba77ad27b0a5e460e5b5e315bc71c6ffb2b07eb5a14b6a69e",
